Package: shai-installer
Version: 0.6.4
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aabey LLC <info@aabeyllc.com>
Depends: apt, bash, coreutils, dconf-cli, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, grep, iproute2, libglib2.0-bin, python3, python3-gi, sed, systemd, util-linux, xdg-utils
Description: SHAI Setup for Ubuntu Desktop
 SHAI means Smart Home Automation and AI. This package installs an inert
 graphical setup application, exact protected debloat catalogs, SHAI theme assets,
 and core application shells. System changes begin only after the desktop user
 reviews and explicitly approves the setup plan. Ubuntu remains the operating
 system.
